It _could_ be anywhere on the computer, where ever the config file says it
is, but if you don't know, then it was probably not created. The dump file
creation is not a standard feature of vanilla Nethack, but a patch. So, if
you run binaries downloaded from the devteam site, you don't have it. You
only have it if you patched and compiled the game yourself or downloaded a
patched binary packet from somewhere else.

